OL,3,GNEWSATeen killed motorbike rider with
OL,4,Aspeeding overtake
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding teenage driver killed an
OL,7,Foncoming motorbike rider with a "highly
OL,8,Fdangerous" overtake of queuing traffic,
OL,9,Fa court has heard.
OL,11,FJack Appleton was 17 when he hit
OL,12,F29-year-old Andrew Robson on Spring
OL,13,FRoad in Murton, County Durham, on 22
OL,14,FSeptember, Teesside Crown Court heard.
OL,16,FAppleton, now aged 19 and of Coach Lane
OL,17,Fin Hazlerigg, Newcastle, admitted
OL,18,Fcausing death by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
